-houston-qb-conner-weigman-henderson-start","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Which teams have the best odds to make the College Football Playoff?","description":"We are tracking the odds for making the CFP, earning a bye and winning it all.","published":"2026-11-21T16:04:07.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532919/college-football-playoff-odds-predictions","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios for Week 12?","description":"Here's what teams from every conference would need to play for their league championship.","published":"2026-11-21T16:00:59.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512475/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Sources: Michigan expected to start Bryce Underwood vs. UCLA","description":"Michigan is returning to QB Bryce Underwood vs. No. 4 UCLA after Tommy Carr had started the past four games, sources told ESPN.","published":"2026-11-21T20:16:18.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50549879/sources-michigan-expected-start-bryce-underwood-vs-ucla","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Sources: Texas A&M expected to bench Marcel Reed, start Brady Hart","description":"Texas A&M is expected to make a change at quarterback, going with sophomore Brady Hart over Marcel Reed against Oklahoma, sources confirmed to ESPN.","published":"2026-11-21T15:29:18.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50549670/sources-texas-expected-bench-marcel-reed-vs-sooners","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4899488/amauri-washington","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A%27Mauri_Washington"},"pick":{"pick":26,"round":1,"team":"KC","provisional":true},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"A'Mauri Washington","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A%27Mauri_Washington","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-18T13:13:47Z","intro":"A'Mauri Washington is an American college football defensive tackle for the Oregon Ducks.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Washington attended Oak Park High School in Oak Park, Michigan for his freshman and sophomore years before transferring to Chandler High School in Chandler, Arizona for his junior and senior years. He committed to the University of Oregon to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Washington was a backup his first two years at Oregon in 2023 and 2024, appearing in 22 games and recording 12 tackles. He became a starter for the first time his junior year in 2025."}]}}